        "Norms retain EFPA's meaning of reference distributions or critical standards; task answer keys and human difficulty matching are not substituted for norms.",
        "Fair use is examined as comparability across AI configurations and exposure conditions; this does not establish human demographic fairness.",
        "Digital reports are provisionally interpreted as numerical evaluation outputs; psychological narrative-report properties are not assumed.",
        "Feedback to an AI test taker is inapplicable as human debriefing; stakeholder guidance remains relevant."
