      "closing_note": "The requested JSON shape does not specify a type for instrument_review; a structured object preserves item coverage. The source's 7.2.8 summary reference conflicts with substantive item 7.2.7. Missing dates, complete sources and report samples prevent firmer ratings; no reviewer identity was inferred."
